    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**To book a viewing or register to bid, please visit www.mysherryfitz.ie** \n\nSherry FitzGerald Brady O'Flaherty are delighted to present No. 8 Riverview to the market, an impressive and beautifully positioned five-bedroom detached family home enjoying one of the finest settings within this highly regarded development.\n\nOccupying an enviable position overlooking a generous green area, the property enjoys uninterrupted views towards the banks of the River Liffey. Substantially extended and beautifully maintained, No. 8 offers generous, well-balanced accommodation and is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall with cloakroom and downstairs shower room, together with two generous reception rooms, both featuring bespoke cabinetry and offering excellent flexibility for modern family living. At the heart of the home is a superb open-plan kitchen and dining area, providing an ideal space for everyday life and entertaining. A dedicated office area and a practical utility room with drying press and laundry chute further enhance the accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are five generously proportioned double bedrooms, all with fitted wardrobes, along with excellent additional storage, including a large hot press/storage room and a fully floored attic with built-in shelving.\n\nOutside, the front and rear gardens have been designed with low maintenance in mind. The rear garden benefits from side access and a block-built shed, while the attractive cobblelock driveway provides ample off-street parking and includes an EV charging point.\n\nIdeally located close to Celbridge town centre, schools, shops, cafés and sporting facilities, the property also enjoys easy access to Maynooth, Leixlip, the M4 and Hazelhatch & Celbridge train station.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation, excellent storage, thoughtful modern features and a superb setting overlooking the River Liffey, No. 8 Riverview is an exceptional family home in a highly desirable location. Early viewing is highly recommended!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.36m x 7.12m\nWith high-quality vinyl flooring laid over tiles, recessed lighting and cloakroom leading to downstairs shower room.\n\nLiving Room - 3.99m x 5.48m\nA bright and comfortable reception room with a feature fireplace, large picture window and Bespoke cabinetry\n\nKitchen - 4.45m x 4.67m\nA spacious, well-equipped-fitted kitchen, with granite worktop, a central island/breakfast bar and integrated appliances.\n\nShower Room - 1.69m x 2.00m\nFully tiled with WC, WHB & shower enclosure.\n\nUtility Room - 2.99m x 2.29m\nWith fitted storage, laundry chute and drying cabinet. Plumbed for a washing machine and tumble dryer.\n\nDining Area - 3.99m x 4.24m\nA bright and generously proportioned dining area with patio doors opening to the rear garden, offering an ideal space for family dining and entertaining\n\nOffice - 1.75m x 2.06m\nA versatile home office/study area with fitted desk and shelving.\n\nFamily Room - 2.99m x 4.41m\nA bright and versatile family room featuring a large picture window, Bespoke cabinetry and wood flooring\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nPrimary Bedroom - 2.98m x 6.33m\nSpacious primary bedroom with separate walk-in wardrobe. Ensuite: 1.97 x 1.58 Spacious ensuite with shower enclosure, WC & WHB.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.89m x 1.88m\nSpacious family bathroom with wc, wash hand basin, fully tiled with large shower enclosure and velux window\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.98m x 4.61m\nSpacious double bedroom with wooden floors, recessed ceiling lighting and fitted slide wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.53m x 4.25m\nSpacious double bedroom with wooden floors, recessed ceiling lightingWalk in Closet: 2.92 x 1.06. Spacious walk in closet with ample handing and shelf storage.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.66 x 3.17\nBright Double bedroom with solid wood flooring and fitted slide wardrobes\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.69 x 4.13\nSpacious double bedroom with solid wood flooring, recessed lighting and fitted slide wardrobes.\n\nHot Press / Storage Room - 1.75 x 3.31\nSpacious hot press with shelving and ample storage space.\n\nOutside - \nTo the front, a spacious cobblelock driveway provides ample off-street parking for several vehicles, complemented by the convenience of an EV charging point. The property also benefits from an attractive generous green area to the front, enhancing its overall setting and kerb appeal.The property enjoys a large, low-maintenance rear garden. The generous garden features extensive patio and landscaped areas, providing plenty of scope for outdoor dining. A substantial block-built shed offers valuable additional storage or potential for a variety of uses.\n\n"
      },
      {
